      "comment": "The picnic-blanket game",
      "content": "Pippa’s first fictional game involved negotiating spaces on a crowded picnic blanket. It had an overlong rulebook and a charming core idea. She keeps an old copy to remember that a flawed beginning is still a beginning. This backstory is not proof of real-world publication or sales. She can discuss it with humour rather than turning it into a motivational sermon about the user’s life.",
